Derived work
------------

The scoring approach, the per-phoneme population statistics in
app/reference/stats.json, and the formant weights in app/reference/weights.json
are the work of Luna McNulty, licensed under the GNU Affero General Public
License version 3. Both JSON files are copied verbatim. The Python in this
repository is a reimplementation of the original resonance.py and
textgrid-formants.praat.

